# Generated / downloaded data — never belongs in an image. `reports/` in
# particular holds run outputs (prompts, model responses) and can be hundreds of
# MB. The Dockerfile copies an explicit allow-list, but keep these excluded too
# so a future `COPY . .` can't silently ship them.
datasets/
reports/
runs/
